@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
skinparam maxMessageSize 110
title Native Tiny Link - reviewed multiple files
actor Teacher
participant "Native Tiny editor" as Editor
participant "Picker / local scope" as Picker
participant "Editor link adapter" as Adapter
database "Actor-owned draft" as Draft
Teacher -> Editor : Open Link browser in activity form
Editor -> Picker : Actual draft, field and native accepted types
Teacher -> Picker : Select several files; review; import
Picker -> Draft : Revalidate and copy approved batch
Picker -> Adapter : Watch bounded actor-bound completion receipt
Picker --> Editor : Native first-file callback
Editor -> Editor : Insert first link using native selection
Adapter -> Draft : Read completed approved file URLs
Adapter -> Editor : Insert remaining links through public instance
note over Editor, Adapter : One undoable insertion; names escaped as DOM text
Teacher -> Editor : Save or cancel native activity form
@enduml
